      "body": "Hi, thank you for the great work.\nI tried to run the closed-loop debug of uniad_tiny with Mini dataset via docker but came up with the following error\n\n`\nworker@egl710251:/home/Bench2Drive$ bash leaderboard/scripts/run_evaluation_debug.sh\n/home/carla/CarlaUE4.sh -RenderOffScreen -nosound -carla-rpc-port=30000 -graphicsadapter=0 None\n4.26.2-0+++UE4+Release-4.26 522 0\nDisabling core dumps.\nload_world success , attempts=0\ntraffic_manager init success, try_time=0\n/home/Bench2DriveZoo/mmcv/models/modules/multi_scale_deformable_attn_function.py:18: FutureWarning: `torch.cuda.amp.custom_fwd(args...)` is deprecated. Please use `torch.amp.custom_fwd(args..., device_type='cuda')` instead.\n  @custom_fwd(cast_inputs=torch.float16)\n/home/Bench2DriveZoo/mmcv/models/modules/multi_scale_deformable_attn_function.py:57: FutureWarning: `torch.cuda.amp.custom_bwd(args...)` is deprecated. Please use `torch.amp.custom_bwd(args..., device_type='cuda')` instead.\n  def backward(ctx, grad_output):\n/home/Bench2DriveZoo/mmcv/models/modules/multi_scale_deformable_attn_function.py:93: FutureWarning: `torch.cuda.amp.custom_fwd(args...)` is deprecated. Please use `torch.amp.custom_fwd(args..., device_type='cuda')` instead.\n  @custom_fwd(cast_inputs=torch.float32)\n/home/Bench2DriveZoo/mmcv/models/modules/multi_scale_deformable_attn_function.py:133: FutureWarning: `torch.cuda.amp.custom_bwd(args...)` is deprecated. Please use `torch.amp.custom_bwd(args..., device_type='cuda')` instead.\n  def backward(ctx, grad_output):\n/home/Bench2DriveZoo/adzoo/bevformer/mmdet3d_plugin/dd3d/structures/boxes3d.py:75: FutureWarning: `torch.cuda.amp.autocast(args...)` is deprecated. Please use `torch.amp.autocast('cuda', args...)` instead.\n  @amp.autocast(enabled=False)\nProblem reading checkpoint. Found no data\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"leaderboard/leaderboard/leaderboard_evaluator.py\", line 564, in <module>\n    main()\n  File \"leaderboard/leaderboard/leaderboard_evaluator.py\", line 554, in main\n    crashed = leaderboard_evaluator.run(arguments)\n  File \"leaderboard/leaderboard/leaderboard_evaluator.py\", line 467, in run\n    self.statistics_manager.clear_records()\n  File \"/home/Bench2Drive/leaderboard/leaderboard/utils/statistics_manager.py\", line 221, in clear_records\n    with open(self._endpoint, 'w') as fd:\nPermissionError: [Errno 13] Permission denied: 'eval.json'\n`\n\nHere is my run_evaluation_debug.sh\n\n#!/bin/bash\nBASE_PORT=30000\nBASE_TM_PORT=50000\nIS_BENCH2DRIVE=True\nBASE_ROUTES=leaderboard/data/bench2drive220\nTEAM_AGENT=leaderboard/team_code/uniad_b2d_agent.py\n#TEAM_CONFIG=your_team_agent_ckpt.pth   # for TCP and ADMLP\nTEAM_CONFIG=Bench2DriveZoo/adzoo/uniad/configs/stage2_e2e/tiny_e2e_b2d.py+Bench2DriveZoo/ckpts/uniad_tiny_b2d.pth # for UniAD and VAD\nBASE_CHECKPOINT_ENDPOINT=eval\nSAVE_PATH=./eval_v1/\nPLANNER_TYPE=only_traj\n\nGPU_RANK=0\nPORT=$BASE_PORT\nTM_PORT=$BASE_TM_PORT\nROUTES=\"${BASE_ROUTES}.xml\"\nCHECKPOINT_ENDPOINT=\"${BASE_CHECKPOINT_ENDPOINT}.json\"\nbash leaderboard/scripts/run_evaluation.sh $PORT $TM_PORT $IS_BENCH2DRIVE $ROUTES $TEAM_AGENT $TEAM_CONFIG $CHECKPOINT_ENDPOINT $SAVE_PATH $PLANNER_TYPE $GPU_RANK\n\nI followed all instructions. It seems there is no checkpoint data, and I also can't find the 'eval.json'",
